## Why This Is Asked
Evaluates real-world trade-offs for multi-tenant isolation, latency budgets, and safe deployment patterns in Azure.

## Key Concepts
- Per-tenant isolation across AKS namespaces or containers
- Latency targets and caching strategies (Redis, shared nothing)
- Canary/blue-green rollout and rollback mechanisms
- Observability: Application Insights, logs, traces
- Cost governance and autoscaling

